---
import { profile } from '../data/site';
---
<section class="maker-section" id="maker" aria-labelledby="maker-heading">
  <div class="wrap content-section-grid">
    <div class="section-label"><span class="section-index">03</span><h2 id="maker-heading"><span data-lang="zh">关于开发者</span><span data-lang="en">About the maker</span></h2></div>
    <div class="section-content"><p class="maker-copy" data-lang="zh">我是 Mr Z，专注于 Windows 桌面工具、WPF/.NET 和面向普通用户的软件体验。我希望把真正有用的能力，做成不需要先成为专家才能使用的工具。</p><p class="maker-copy" data-lang="en">I am Mr Z, focused on Windows desktop utilities, WPF/.NET, and software experiences for everyday users. I turn useful capabilities into tools that do not require people to become experts first.</p><div class="stack">{profile.stack.map((item) => <span>{item}</span>)}</div></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="method-section" id="about" aria-labelledby="method-heading">
  <div class="wrap content-section-grid">
    <div class="section-label"><span class="section-index">04</span><h2 id="method-heading"><span data-lang="zh">产品方法</span><span data-lang="en">Product approach</span></h2></div>
    <div class="section-content"><p class="statement" data-lang="zh">好的工具不应制造焦虑。它应该让复杂的事情<em>变得可见、可选、可控。</em></p><p class="statement" data-lang="en">Good tools should not create anxiety. They should make complex things <em>visible, optional, and controllable.</em></p><div class="principles"><div class="principle"><b data-lang="zh">先看清楚</b><b data-lang="en">See clearly</b><p data-lang="zh">用能被理解的分类代替杂乱文件列表。</p><p data-lang="en">Use understandable categories, not a wall of files.</p></div><div class="principle"><b data-lang="zh">再做决定</b><b data-lang="en">Decide deliberately</b><p data-lang="zh">在动作发生前说明范围与影响。</p><p data-lang="en">Show scope and impact before an action happens.</p></div><div class="principle"><b data-lang="zh">安心完成</b><b data-lang="en">Finish with confidence</b><p data-lang="zh">用克制的体验帮助用户专注真正重要的事。</p><p data-lang="en">Use restraint so people can focus on what matters.</p></div></div></div>
  </div>
</section>
